==Battleground==
*1 [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Cosmic Cyclone]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is a good idea to take down the Cosmic Cyclone first, then focus on the less-threatening Ururun Wolf. Cats with [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] or [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] abilities are necessary to counter the Cyclone, especially ones that can be spawned in groups like [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necro-Dancer Cat]] or [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]]. [[:Category:Backliner-class Cats|Backliners]], [[:Category:Super-Backliner-class Cats|Super-Backliners]] and [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] can be a great benefit to hit the Cyclone from afar, as well as take down Ururun once the Cyclone is finished.

